WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.500
Two crouching light punches begin the corner starter.

2
00:00:01.500 --> 00:00:02.300
Light Donkey Kick knocks Ken down.

3
00:00:02.300 --> 00:00:03.200
Standing medium punch misses as a timing action.

4
00:00:03.200 --> 00:00:04.000
Collarbone Breaker connects on wake-up.

5
00:00:04.000 --> 00:00:05.000
Standing light punch cancels into heavy Shoryuken.

6
00:00:05.000 --> 00:00:05.550
Ken falls after the overhead conversion.
